sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer (Claude Code IDE)
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Queue as Job Queue
    participant Status as Status Poller

    Dev->>Dev: User types:<br/>"Run deep-explore on pricing strategy decision"

    Note over Dev,MCP: MCP Protocol (JSON-RPC over stdio)

    Dev->>+MCP: ToolCall: run_deep_explore<br/>{decision: "pricing strategy", depth: "standard"}

    MCP->>MCP: Translate MCP request to API call
    MCP->>+Gateway: POST /v1/jobs<br/>{process_id: "deep-explore", inputs: {...}}
    Gateway->>+Orch: SubmitJob(...)
    Orch->>Queue: EnqueueMessage(...)
    Orch-->>-Gateway: {job_id: "uuid-123"}
    Gateway-->>-MCP: 202 Accepted {job_id}

    MCP->>MCP: Start async status polling

    loop Poll every 10 seconds (max 30 minutes)
        MCP->>+Gateway: GET /v1/jobs/{job_id}
        Gateway->>+Orch: GetJobStatus(job_id)
        Orch-->>-Gateway: {status, phase, progress_pct}
        Gateway-->>-MCP: JobStatus

        alt Job Completed
            MCP->>+Gateway: GET /v1/jobs/{job_id}/artifacts
            Gateway-->>-MCP: ArtifactList[{name, url}]

            MCP->>+Gateway: GET /v1/artifacts/{artifact_id}
            Gateway-->>-MCP: YAML artifact (option-map.yaml)

            MCP->>MCP: Parse YAML, extract key findings
            MCP-->>Dev: ToolResult:<br/>"Option Map Generated:<br/>- CL-001: Fast Market Entry (Recommended)<br/>- CL-002: Enterprise First<br/>- CL-003: Open Source<br/>Download full report: [link]"
            Note over Dev: User sees results in chat UI
        else Job Running
            MCP-->>Dev: ToolProgress:<br/>"Phase 3/6 (Clustering) - 50% complete"
        else Gate Failed
            MCP-->>Dev: ToolError:<br/>"Gate GATE_3 LOCKED: Failed counter-check CC-CLU-02"
        end
    end

    alt Timeout (30 minutes)
        MCP-->>-Dev: ToolError:<br/>"Job timeout. Status: Running. Check dashboard for details."
    end
